{"identity_key": "x:2112494679594070402", "source_id": "x", "item_id": "2112494679594070402", "title": null, "content": "Steam🔥2026 Next Fest new game demos are now open!\n\n👉2026 Steam Next Fest 10/20–10/27 (UTC+8)\n\nThis time, akaeroCore brings you three masterpiece games from DLsite ✨\n\nWithout further ado, head over to Steam and try them out for yourself! 👇\n\n\n\n🔒 SEVEN DAYS: Strange Locked-Room Life #Mystery #Puzzle\n\n→https://nitter.cf/t.co/n5S2DOdEP5\n\nYou, a journalist, and “Lila,” the daughter of a pharmaceutical company’s president, are trapped in a sealed room and forced to take part in a seven-day extreme confinement game. Can you escape the room together with Lila and uncover the truth?\n\n\n\n🗡️ False Myth 2 ~Egoism of Love and Hate~ #RPG #Harem\n\n→https://nitter.cf/t.co/VVQLgGJw8y\n\nRouge, a female assassin who was injected with poison and turned into a man, rescues a mysterious, expressionless girl named “Sylphina” this time. Kind-hearted Rouge and his new companions decide to protect her while exploring the mystery of Sylphina’s origins.\n\n\n\n✝️ Unholy Maiden #RPG #MultipleEndings #HighFreedom\n\n→https://nitter.cf/t.co/rUrCHxZxlS\n\nAtra, a girl with amnesia, steps once more into the dangerous underground city of Rozford to recover the memories that were taken from her. Every decision you make will shape her life, and your choices will determine Atra’s fate.\n\n\n\n🎀akaeroCore：https://nitter.cf/t.co/bY6lPbSzM7\n\n💛Join Discord：https://nitter.cf/t.co/Cezj2TG7Sn\n\n\n\n#akaeroCore #steam #SteamNextFest #steam新品節 #RPG #後宮", "publisher": "akaerocore", "canonical_url": "https://x.com/akaerocore/status/2112494679594070402", "published_at": "2026-10-20T10:42:34+00:00", "published_at_raw": "Tue, 20 Oct 2026 10:42:34 GMT", "published_precision": "second", "fetched_at": "2026-11-01T04:49:44.474889+00:00", "media": [], "metadata": {"account": "akaerocore", "author_name": "akaerocore", "is_retweet": false, "retweeted_by": null, "is_reply": false, "reply_to": null, "is_quote": false, "quoted_tweet_id": null, "quoted_author": null, "quoted_text": null, "is_pinned": false, "stats": {"replies": null, "retweets": null, "likes": null, "views": null}, "provider": "nitter", "route": "rss"}}
{"identity_key": "x:2112494764520317397", "source_id": "x", "item_id": "2112494764520317397", "title": null, "content": "Steam🔥2026新品節新遊戲試玩DEMO正式開放！\n\n👉2026 Steam Next Fest 10/20-10/27(UTC+8 )\n\n這次akaeroCore為大家帶來了DLsite三款神作遊戲✨\n\n話不多說趕快來Steam親自己驗一下吧！👇👇👇\n\n\n\n🔒 SEVEN DAYS 未知的密室生活 #懸疑 #解迷\n\n→https://nitter.cf/t.co/n5S2DOdEP5\n\n身為記者的你與製藥公司社長千金「莉拉」被困於一間封閉的密室之中，被迫參加為期七天的極限監禁遊戲，究竟你是否可以帶著莉拉一起逃出密室並挖出真相呢？\n\n\n\n🗡️ False Myth 2~愛憎的自我沉溺~ #RPG #後宮\n\n→https://nitter.cf/t.co/VVQLgGJw8y\n\n被注射毒藥變成男性的女刺客「羅赫」，這次他救下了一位沒有情緒表情的神秘少女「希爾菲娜」，善良的羅赫與新夥伴們決定保護她，同時探尋希爾菲娜的身世之謎。\n\n\n\n✝️ 褻瀆聖女 #RPG #多結局 #高自由度\n\n→https://nitter.cf/t.co/rUrCHxZxlS\n\n失憶少女愛特菈為了找尋回自己被奪走的記憶，再次踏入危險的地下都市羅茲弗德，而你的每一個決斷都講影響她的人生走向，你的選擇將決定愛特菈的命運。\n\n\n\n🎀akaeroCore：https://nitter.cf/t.co/bY6lPbSzM7\n\n💛Join Discord：https://nitter.cf/t.co/Cezj2TG7Sn\n\n\n\n#akaeroCore #steam #SteamNextFest #steam新品節 #RPG #後宮", "publisher": "akaerocore", "canonical_url": "https://x.com/akaerocore/status/2112494764520317397", "published_at": "2026-10-20T10:42:54+00:00", "published_at_raw": "Tue, 20 Oct 2026 10:42:54 GMT", "published_precision": "second", "fetched_at": "2026-11-01T04:49:44.474889+00:00", "media": [], "metadata": {"account": "akaerocore", "author_name": "akaerocore", "is_retweet": false, "retweeted_by": null, "is_reply": false, "reply_to": null, "is_quote": false, "quoted_tweet_id": null, "quoted_author": null, "quoted_text": null, "is_pinned": false, "stats": {"replies": null, "retweets": null, "likes": null, "views": null}, "provider": "nitter", "route": "rss"}}
{"identity_key": "x:2112495260324773975", "source_id": "x", "item_id": "2112495260324773975", "title": null, "content": "Steam🔥2026 신작 축제 체험판(DEMO) 정식 공개!\n\n👉2026 Steam Next Fest 10/20-10/27(UTC+8 )\n\n이번에도 akaeroCore가 여러분을 위해 DLsite의 명작 게임 3종을 준비했습니다✨\n\n긴말 필요 없이 지금 바로 Steam에서 직접 체험해 보세요!👇\n\n\n\n🔒 《세븐 데이즈: 낯선 밀실 생활》 #미스터리 #추리\n\n→ https://nitter.cf/t.co/qqCluUodWJ\n\n기자인 당신은 제약회사 사장의 딸 '리라'와 함께 밀실에 갇혀 7일간 이어지는 극한의 감금 게임에 강제로 참가하게 됩니다. 과연 당신은 리라와 함께 밀실에서 탈출해 사건의 진실을 밝혀낼 수 있을까요?\n\n\n\n🗡️ 《False Myth 2 애증의 자아 탐닉》 #RPG #하렘\n\n→ https://nitter.cf/t.co/YrOnn0qNmP\n\n독약을 주입당해 남성으로 변해버린 여성 암살자 '루쥬'. 이번에는 감정도 표정도 없는 수수께끼의 소녀 '실피나'를 구하게 됩니다. 선한 마음을 지닌 루쥬는 새로운 동료들과 함께 그녀를 지켜주며, 실피나의 출생에 얽힌 비밀을 밝혀내기로 결심합니다.\n\n\n\n✝️ 《언홀리 메이든》 #RPG #멀티엔딩 #높은자유도\n\n→ https://nitter.cf/t.co/JRjLSu83UH\n\n기억을 잃은 소녀 '아트라'는 빼앗긴 기억을 되찾기 위해 위험한 지하도시 '로즈포드'에 다시 발을 들입니다. 당신이 내리는 모든 선택이 그녀의 인생에 영향을 미치며, 그 선택에 따라 아트라의 운명이 달라집니다.\n\n\n\n🎀akaeroCore：https://nitter.cf/t.co/ZEcKX9Vbe8\n\n💛Join Discord：https://nitter.cf/t.co/GvTc4eQn7i\n\n\n\n#akaeroCore #steam #SteamNextFest #steam신작축제 #RPG #하렘", "publisher": "akaeroCore_kr", "canonical_url": "https://x.com/akaeroCore_kr/status/2112495260324773975", "published_at": "2026-10-20T10:44:52+00:00", "published_at_raw": "Tue, 20 Oct 2026 10:44:52 GMT", "published_precision": "second", "fetched_at": "2026-11-01T04:49:46.012977+00:00", "media": [], "metadata": {"account": "akaeroCore_kr", "author_name": "Pinned", "is_retweet": false, "retweeted_by": null, "is_reply": false, "reply_to": null, "is_quote": false, "quoted_tweet_id": null, "quoted_author": null, "quoted_text": null, "is_pinned": false, "stats": {"replies": null, "retweets": null, "likes": null, "views": null}, "provider": "nitter", "route": "rss"}}
